/*
 * Individually permit-locked star systems.
 *
 * Source: the community-maintained "Elite Dangerous Permit Database" spreadsheet,
 * obtained via canonn-signals, with system addresses from Spansh cross-checked against
 * EDSM. Permit locks are published in no game data file or API, so the list is
 * hand-maintained and best-effort.
 *
 * Credit and licence terms: ATTRIBUTIONS.md. Acquisition, revisions, derivation and
 * corrections: data/astro/SOURCES.md.
 *
 * Each system address is a decimal string so every language can parse it without
 * IEEE-754 loss. Addresses come from Spansh, cross-checked against EDSM for the
 * systems EDSM holds; no disagreement. Plaa Ain HA-Z d46 is absent from both and is
 * encoded from its procedural name by this project.
 */
